  "dock": {
    "note": "The persistent bottom dock (SPEC 1.4). One surface owned by presentation/dock.lua, NOT a scene's window: its state survives scene changes, so moving between two scenes that want the same variant animates nothing at all. Scenes pick a variant with config.dock in scenes.json; geometry per window still comes from windowLayout above. Adding a variant is a data edit. Still outside the dock: reserve_party (read by name from Lua in window_renderer's drawSwapIndicator) and status_dock (binds sel('status_party'), a SCENE window, which a variant's list cache cannot see) — both need code changes first, not just data.",
